{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nunit/nunit/issues/153","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nunit/nunit","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nunit/nunit/issues/153/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nunit/nunit/issues/153/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nunit/nunit/issues/153/events","html_url":"https://github.com/nunit/nunit/issues/153","id":37902009,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWUzNzkwMjAwOQ==","number":153,"title":"Surprising behaviour of DelayedConstraint pollingInterval","user":{"login":"b-e-n-j","id":2520078,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MjAwNzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2520078?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/b-e-n-j","html_url":"https://github.com/b-e-n-j","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b-e-n-j/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b-e-n-j/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b-e-n-j/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b-e-n-j/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b-e-n-j/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b-e-n-j/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b-e-n-j/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b-e-n-j/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b-e-n-j/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":61608514,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw2MTYwODUxNA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nunit/nunit/labels/is:bug","name":"is:bug","color":"fc2929","default":false,"description":null},{"id":61616795,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw2MTYxNjc5NQ==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nunit/nunit/labels/closed:done","name":"closed:done","color":"0e8a16","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nunit/nunit/milestones/3","html_url":"https://github.com/nunit/nunit/milestone/3","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nunit/nunit/milestones/3/labels","id":735498,"node_id":"MDk6TWlsZXN0b25lNzM1NDk4","number":3,"title":"2.9.7","description":"Release binaries with all pre-3.0 ongoing work that has been completed, so as to simplify moving to the first 3.0 alpha release.","creator":{"login":"CharliePoole","id":2678661,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2Nzg2NjE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2678661?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CharliePoole","html_url":"https://github.com/CharliePoole","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CharliePoole/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CharliePoole/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CharliePoole/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CharliePoole/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CharliePoole/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CharliePoole/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CharliePoole/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CharliePoole/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CharliePoole/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":0,"closed_issues":32,"state":"closed","created_at":"2014-07-29T12:18:13Z","updated_at":"2014-08-11T19:16:24Z","due_on":"2014-08-10T07:00:00Z","closed_at":"2014-08-11T19:16:24Z"},"comments":1,"created_at":"2014-07-15T16:37:45Z","updated_at":"2014-11-21T18:32:41Z","closed_at":"2014-08-06T16:03:49Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"The Syntax Helper `After(int, int)` creates a DelayedConstraint with a 'pollingInterval', which allows a test to run quicker in the event that it passes early.\n\nHowever, it has some surprising behaviour if the test is going to fail. The 'delay' parameter is not the absolute time delay between starting the assertion and failing, but it is the elapsed time only while waiting to poll. It ignores any time spent in the condition expression.\n\nIf the condition expression is calling a method with a timeout, then the test can fail much more slowly than if the pollingInterval were not there.\n\nFor example:\n\n```\nAssert.That(() => { Thread.Sleep(1000); return false; }, Is.True.After(2000));\n```\n\nfails after 3s as expected.\n\nBut\n\n```\nAssert.That(() => { Thread.Sleep(1000); return false; }, Is.True.After(2000, 100));\n```\n\nfails after 20s.\n\nFor pure unit testing, this shouldn't be a problem. But when integration testing async expressions which might be timing out, then I think it's undesirable.\n\nIs there a good reason for it to work this way?\n","closed_by":{"login":"CharliePoole","id":2678661,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2Nzg2NjE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2678661?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CharliePoole","html_url":"https://github.com/CharliePoole","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CharliePoole/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CharliePoole/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CharliePoole/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CharliePoole/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CharliePoole/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CharliePoole/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CharliePoole/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CharliePoole/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CharliePoole/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nunit/nunit/issues/153/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nunit/nunit/issues/153/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}